  "claim_status": "source_derived_unreviewed",
  "reported_status": "Integration-derived restricted proofs and exact/floating fixtures; no independent external validation. Source and internally derived claims remain unreviewed. External correctness, historical priority and physical validity are UNKNOWN. Exact/floating diagnostics, producer-code replay and same-team analytic criticism do not independently validate universal mathematics, novelty or scientific capability.",
  "scientific_scope_status": "Internally derived finite-dimensional information boundary: for every fixed k, all specified vacuum correlations with at most k creations and k annihilations fail to determine a grand-canonical coupled design sign. Hidden interaction order is k+1. A separate supplied normal-ordered order-p promise plus complete labelled sector operators up to p reconstructs the bath by standard CAR algebra with explicit sharp error amplification. No two-body/material impossibility or efficient physical tomography theorem.",
